            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Bai Rac",
            "review_text": "Khai L\n2 contributions\n0\nBest com tam in hcmc\nOct 2018 • Couples\nThis is a hidden local hotspot for natives to dine on the best com tam in the city, you can often see Vietnam’s celebrities eating here, ironically it’s located right by a dumpster area so the area looks kinda dirty and gritty but don’t let that turn you away, the utensils and dishes are clean. If you come here order the cold milk soybean drink along with grilled pork ribs rice. It will change your life.\nWritten October 3, 2018",
